## Why This Is Asked
Tests mastery of CSS Grid, dense packing, and advanced layout techniques like container queries. It also probes accessibility, motion preferences, and purely CSS interactivity.

## Key Concepts
- CSS Grid with grid-auto-flow: dense
- 16:9 aspect areas and slide-up caption
- Container queries (container-type and @container)
- prefers-reduced-motion and focus-visible

## Code Example
```css
.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); grid-auto-flow: dense; container-type: inline-size; }
.card { aspect-ratio: 16/9; position: relative; }
.caption { transform: translateY(100%); transition: transform .25s ease; }
.grid > .card:hover .caption, .grid > .card:focus-within .caption { transform: translateY(0); }
